                                "example_id": "39ed78d9-c3ce-4806-81eb-c2ca40e8190b",
                                "sense_id": "041f8344-d5b4-3a5e-b30a-f7a0f1220795",
                                "text": "Sometime ſhe feared, leaſt ſome hard miſhap / Had him misfalne in his aduenturous queſt; [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5c89d70-8ae3-4907-91eb-40be8c7c5fc7",
                                "sense_id": "041f8344-d5b4-3a5e-b30a-f7a0f1220795",
                                "text": "[...] let us abide together that, one with the counsel and that other with the deed, then may there nothing misfall to usward."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eccb7930-b68e-443b-a49a-7606f59594e5",
                                "sense_id": "041f8344-d5b4-3a5e-b30a-f7a0f1220795",
                                "text": "However, the principal and his students worked hard, and they soon had the buildings in shape for use and the farm doing as well as possible. Then a terrible misfortune misfell one of the neighbors who was most bitter in his tirades."
                            }
